      "source_hash": "44211d02ee313d114c1ed9a9a1862d7936c533bec494776acdc02ea82cf5238d",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The Chinese-language first page of the draft first report of Committee A of the Fifty-third World Health Assembly (2000), recording officers elected and recommending a resolution on Stop TB; the header contains some OCR noise.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "第五十三届世界卫生大会（2000年）甲委员会第一份报告草案的中文首页，记录当选的官员，并建议通过一项关于控制结核行动的决议；页眉含有一些光学字符识别杂讯。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-83077/blocks/prose-page-002",
      "source": "sections/page-002.md",
      "source_hash": "5906a86ec6537832d360f97748f1448221e403333752b55c7271eb921fca80af",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Opens the Chinese text of the draft Stop TB resolution, noting that the global TB burden hinders development and that most high-burden countries will miss the 2000 targets. It urges Member States to endorse the Amsterdam Declaration, expand DOTS, secure domestic resources and make TB control a priority within primary health care.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "控制结核行动决议草案中文文本开篇，指出全球结核病负担阻碍发展，且结核病负担最重的大多数国家将无法实现2000年的目标。决议敦促会员国认可《阿姆斯特丹控制结核宣言》、扩大直接督导下的短程化疗战略、确保国内资源，并在初级卫生保健中把结核控制列为优先事项。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-83077/blocks/prose-page-003",
      "source": "sections/page-003.md",
      "source_hash": "31debca94b679e62e0d34c126c425610381098d0020dc48a281b94f6d27ec5d5",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Continues the draft TB resolution in Chinese, asking Member States to integrate TB control into primary care, track case detection and treatment success, and address TB–HIV and multidrug resistance. It calls on international partners to join the global partnership and asks the Director-General to support countries with drug access and research on new diagnostics.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "结核决议草案中文文本续，要求会员国将结核控制纳入初级卫生保健、跟踪病例检出率和治疗成功率，并应对结核与艾滋病毒以及耐多药问题。呼吁国际伙伴加入全球联盟，并要求总干事在获得药物和研究新诊断方法方面支持各国。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-83077/blocks/prose-page-004",
      "source": "sections/page-004.md",
      "source_hash": "9efeb08d55751a742a7648945810a5460513ba8599db90834d229cf8239ed99f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Ends the draft TB resolution in Chinese, asking the Director-General to support research on drugs and vaccines, keep active partnerships and back regional TB control plans.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "结核决议草案中文文本结尾，要求总干事支持药物和疫苗研究、保持积极的伙伴关系，并支持区域结核控制规划。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
